	"startPosition": "The start position is standing anywhere in the shooting area, facing down range with wrists below belt. Handgun is loaded and holstered. PCC start position is stock on belt, safety on, muzzle pointing downrange",
	"procedure": "On the audible start signal, engage all targets from within the shooting area.",
